OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FWhen Steve Monite's electronic
OL,17,     Ffunk album flopped, he buried his
OL,18,     Fmusical ambition. More than three
OL,19,     Fdecades later he was shocked to
OL,20,     Ffind stars like Frank Ocean
OL,21,     Fsinging his songs.
