OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1947, a missing goat led to the
OL,7,     Fdiscovery of the Dead Sea Scrolls.
OL,8,     FThese ancient Jewish manuscripts
OL,9,     Fbecame one of the most important
OL,10,     Farchaeological finds of the 20th
OL,11,     Fcentury.
